// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Aaron_Walker 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Aaron Walker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P484008439" "Aaron Walker"
// ProfessionString :
"P3741152103" "Hacker"
// DescriptionString :
"P780498124" "Aaron Walker was a notorious hacker by the name of Lightspeed before he was arrested by the PPD. He served his time in the BAF and was released back into society as a perfectly good law-abiding citizen. Or so the papers say."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2997257705" "<color orange>Aaron Walker's phone rings until you get an automated voice mail message, stating that the number you have reached is no longer in service.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P4259819220" "Neutropolis"
// HelloString :
"P392757643" "What's up? Already know, don't need to say it."
// HelloString :
"P730700274" "We got something to take care of, right?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1102544850" "So even though I'm totally cool, which is why you're talking with me of course, I so totally don't know you.  Why don't you go chat it up with someone who cares, cool?"
// WrongUniverseString :
"P2912326986" "Man, you've got to split. Your imprint is all over the Ministry of Intelligence mainframes. I had to cut through some serious ICE to figure out what's so interesting about you. It wasn't that tough, but it was totally worth it. Don't worry, your secret is safe with me, I scrambled the databases so bad they'll have to reset to a backup from before you arrived. Just fall in with some legit Powers Division members and you shouldn't so much as raise a blip on the Ministry's radar."
// FirstVisitString :
"P427717537" "Ever see a network data packet stop and ask for directions?  I see it all the time, man.  I'm the fastest dude out there on the network.  Well, other than that Neuron piece of - MAN!  What I'd give to upload a virus straight into his own head.  Kinda like what that he did to me.  But hey... whatever.<br> <br>But you know what, man?  He thinks he's all the best and all that?  Thinks he's the fastest dude out there?  Well, he messed up when he screwed around with my brain.  But you know these neuro-stims I gotta take to live?  Yeah... well they make me as fast as him.  And even though they're gonna kill me, I'll use them to give him a taste of MY medicine and see how that punk likes it.<br> <br>So, uh, you wanna get started or something? I don't have all day, you know."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1145900738" "Hey, I got nothing right now.  The network is all quiet, so I think that we've stuck it to 'em for now.  But knowing Neuron, he's probably up to something.  I'll let you know if something pops up, cool?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3740999789" "Dude, you're not as fast as me.  That means you can't do twenty things at once like I can.  Go finish up your stuff before offering to help me, cool?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P892043840" "Things look like they're getting weird, you should wait and stuff until you're at {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2022483603" "This contact I've introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you've chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3567908148" "You mind letting this chick talk to you? She usually isn't a pain like this in my head but she wants to talk to you REALLY badly. Oh, yeah, she might be slightly insane too."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


