// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Anti-Matter 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Anti-Matter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2036207087" "Anti-Matter"
// ProfessionString :
"P1844732285" "Ex-Praetor"
// DescriptionString :
"P693726066" "Anti-Matter was once called Praetor Keyes until his title was removed from him by Emperor Cole himself. Many still called him Praetor out of habit, but he has resigned himself to being called Anti-Matter during his, 'time in exile'."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P26515038" "I don't have time to discuss anything other than the matter at hand."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3980047513" "Begone with your simpleton self, fool.  Can you not see that I am devoting every last synapse within my brain to alleviate the current situation?  Bother me again and I will be sorely tempted to annihilate you."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P2764179686" "I haven't time to waste talking to every costumed hero come to see me on <i>important business</i>. Nothing you have is as important as my current work. Go bug Neuron."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3940347556" "Since I'm in direct contact with you, {HeroName}, you'll refer to me by my real name, Anti-Matter.  I don't have time for the Praetor formalities.  I've heard that you are the best amongst those loyal to Praetoria, which is why I have requisitioned your services.  The work I am doing here on my island is of the upmost importance to Emperor Cole, therefore it is only logical that it is as important to you, too.  I have a vital task that I am about to entrust to you.  I am hoping for your sake that you understand the gravity of the situation."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3601061370" "I currently have the situation under control.  I am tasking you to root out all Resistance traitors and deal with them in an appropriately painful manner."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1022720157" "You have too many things to handle. Why would I try to ask you for help when you can barely finish what you've started?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2538482287" "The task I have for you is something that would require someone like me to take care of.  Unless you can find some way to augment your powers to an equivalent of Security Level {Level}, I can not use you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P4196712968" "Anti-Matter was known as Praetor Keyes until Emperor Cole stripped him of his rank. Now, he works on various tasks handed down to him by Praetor Berry and Emperor Cole from within his island in Neutropolis."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
