// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Crow 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Crow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3549693702" "Crow"
// ProfessionString :
"P2581526681" "Resistance Leader"
// DescriptionString :
"P4237965981" "A member of the late Threat Response Battalion, or TRIBE, Crow is the only survivor of his unit thanks to one of Neuron's more ambitious genetic experiments. Dumped in the tunnels and left to die, Crow found his way to the Resistance where he utilizes his military background to score victory after victory for the Resistance, and gets ever closer to exacting vengeance upon Neuron for his fallen comrades."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2067438578" "<color orange>Nobody answers.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P849098855" "Underground Neutropolis"
// HelloString :
"P538690336" "Hmmm. The spirit of vengeance is with you."
// HelloString :
"P1816883933" "Things are gonna get a lot worse before they get better. Mark my words..."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4165762798" "I don't know you. Did Scott send you to me or what? He said he'd find me someone worth my time, I'm not sure if that's you or not. Go ask Scott."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1377600133" "I do not see a kindred spirit in you. You and I are from different worlds and mine is a place you would find unwholesome."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2739531939" "Mine is a path of vengeance, {HeroName}. I warn you, because if you are not prepared to walk that path, then I do not want you walking it with me.<br><br>Do you wish to walk the path of retribution, death, and blood with me, or is there still hope enough in your heart that such evils have not taken hold of you? If it is the later, then I envy you. The former, then we can mourn for each other while we walk that path together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2582017657" "There has been no movement within our enemies' warren.  This does not mean that they do not stir within.  When it is time to swoop down upon them, I shall inform you, my friend."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4231254852" "A {Hero.gender=male man|woman} whose soul holds the spirit of vengeance has only time for that vengeance. Clear your mind of the problems of others and join me when you are able."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3223980407" "You've got to be rated at least Security Level {Level} before I'll feel confident enough of your abilities to work with you, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1851722994" "You share the vision that I have seen, my new friend.  I wish to remain in contact with you.  We are stronger for working together instead of being lone wolves. Here is my number. From now on you can call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P13036522" "Our quest for vengeance has brought us very close, {HeroName}, like {Hero.gender=male brothers|brother and sister}. Perhaps in one another we can find something worth holding onto this world for."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P573218879" "Your mind has things other than vengeance other. I can't work with you if you're like this."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


