// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Helix 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Helix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P158726144" "Helix"
// ProfessionString :
"P741113880" "Geneticist"
// DescriptionString :
"P359530986" "A senior geneticist and the former assistant to Dr. Hetzfeld. Dr. Helix was abandoned in the tunnels by her collegue and left for dead, but she managed to escape to the Resistance thanks to her environmental suit's cloaking field. Now she continues her research for the good of the Resistance, hoping one day to find a way to rehabilitate the Ghouls and turn them against the mad man responsible for turning them into monsters."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P650101595" "<color orange>You can't get a hold of Helix.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1037903553" "{HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3312851280" "Feeling ok?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2589534166" "I think you're talking to the wrong person. I'm very busy and unless I've been given specific orders to work with you, I don't have the time. Sorry."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P2440197125" "Ah... You're the one Calvin was talking about. Listen, I've got a lot to do already, the most good you could do is to team up with another Powers Division member and help them out. If you go out solo and start talking then the PPD are going to pick you up in no time."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2221620110" "Look around you and you'll see the beauty of Praetoria.  Neuron has been doing a wonderful job of filling the tunnels with his garbage, and I've dedicated my career to finding a way to give those people back a shred of humanity. From what Crow has told me, Neuron has found a way, and if he can find a way, then we can steal it from him."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P658843736" "I'm still rehabilitating a good number of these, what do they call them again, cupcakes?<br><br> Once they're ready, we'll have a new weapon to use against Cole."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P396865050" "I'm going to need all of your attention for the upcoming task.  You'll need to clear your agenda before I can offer it to you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3272103947" "What's your Security Level, {HeroName}. No, no, this won't do.  You'll need to be at Security Level {Level} before I can do this task."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P588621414" "I appreciate your help.  Here's my number so that we can stay in touch. We're going to be very busy in the days to come."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3862125428" "You know, I was wrong about you.  Singlehandedly, you've been able to build something close to an army of ghouls.  With just a couple hundred more, we'll be able to march on Cole's Tower.  Thank you, {HeroName}."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2506873072" "We can't work together, {HeroName}. Come back to me when you're ready to fully devote yourself to the Resistance."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3669117899" "Dr. Helix is a godsend. Really. I don't know who this Hetzfeld joker is, but letting go of a girl like that is plain and simply crazy."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


