// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : IVy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1160928279" "IVy"
// ProfessionString :
"P4193306697" "Clockwork Secretary"
// DescriptionString :
"P3060081580" "Praetor Berry created IVy some time ago to act as a buffer between him and the citizens of Neutropolis. The people would go to Ivy with any issues they may have, be it Resistance attacks, attacks by the Devouring Earth, any general emergency that needed to be handled. IVy would then send reports to the PPD and Praetor Berry to handle. As of late, IVy has been malfunctioning, causing many of her reports to go missing or never reach their intended destination. Praetor Berry has not yet fixed her."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P1063793306" "<color orange>Ivy had been kidnapped by Metronome, you'll have to find her!.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3921913817" "I am welcoming you to Praetor Berry's office, for I am his secretary tasked with that function.  My identification has been given to your person. Now I pause as I await you to respond with your identification."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3683167314" "I am not authorized to delegate to tasks to unidentified subjects.  Confirm that you are a person and I will be able to delegate tasks to you."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P462215548" "I am initiating a greeting to you... Error: Cannot match visual or biometric readings with any known registered citizen or Powers Division Member. Running self-diagnostic, please wait."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4066065949" "Hello! As you may or may not know, my designated name, given to me by the great Praetor Berry, is Ivy! I am here assisting the great people of P-Praetoria with whatever they need!<br><br>However, my systems detect that you are far and beyond that of a normal person here in Praetoria! I have finished loading the list of tasks that I have been given by the good people here in Praetoria. I am showing delight at working with you to clear this list!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P624386460" "I have no remaining tasks that require delegation.  Return to me after passage of time to see if I have been uploaded any more."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P596612108" "The number of tasks that your person is currently assigned is greater than the value I can delegate tasks at.  Reduce the number and I will be able to delegate tasks to your person."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P687507880" "Your Security Level does not meet the minimum required by the tasks I am to delegate.  Return when the value is {Level} or greater."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2415501212" "<color orange>IVy seems unaware of what just transpired between you and Tilman.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1530251498" "<color orange>You feel something prod your mind and see an image of Praetor Tilman flash back and forth in front of your eyes.</color>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
