// Name :
"P133364930" "Praetor Tilman"
// ProfessionString :
"P4187044497" "Praetor and Asylum Warden"
// DescriptionString :
"P14039264" "Shalice Tilman is the most powerful psychic in the world and the pioneer behind the revolutionary Seer Project. Known throughout the Praetorian Empire as Mother, Tilman devoted her life to taking care of others. When a freak accident involving an unstable psychic killed Shalice Tilman, the world mourned her death. Courageously, her colleague, Aurora Borealis, took Shalice's consciousness into her own, saving the woman beloved throughout the world. <br><br>Together the two women can do more to help the world than they ever could apart. With their psychic powers combined, Mother has saved the lives of countless psychics, helping them to become Seers. In turn, these Seers help prevent crime by detecting criminal intent and alerting the authorities before harm can be done. There are certain times, however, when Tilman requires outside help in order to keep the land of Praetoria safe from those who would seek to destroy it."
// LocationString :
"P1262503387" "The Mother of Mercy Psychiatric Hospital"
// HelloString :
"P360619063" "Mother cares about you, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3913460941" "I did not come calling for you, my little one.  When I call you, you'll feel it and do as Mother says."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1913165127" "Mother is very upset right now so you will have to give Mother a little time to collect herself. Until then, why don't you busy yourself with your friends in Powers Division? Now be a good {hero.gender=male boy|girl}, and leave Mother to her thoughts."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2451315002" "Mother doesn't need any thing from you right now, but thank you for asking.  But I thought you knew that.  Are you trying to sneak something past me?  Are you?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2464806358" "When I ask you to do something, I am NOT asking you.  I am TELLING YOU.  You will drop what other things you're doing and DO WHAT MOTHER TELLS YOU!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3802417943" "No, no, dear.  I'm not going to put you in harm's way by asking you to do this little thing for me.  I would never harm a hair on my children's head, now would I?  WOULD I!?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4149381035" "You've done such a good job, {HeroName}.  I knew you would do it.  Didn't I say you could?  But you didn't believe me, did you?  DID YOU?!  YOU DIDN'T BELIEVE MOTHER, DID YOU?! From now on, I want to keep an eye on where you are.  You are not leaving mother's sight, no matter where you go.  Do you understand?!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2671586399" "You have done your mother proud, {HeroName}.  You always were my favorite, you know that right?  RIGHT?!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1200616010" "<color orange>Praetor Tilman is the head of the Seer program within Praetoria. She rarely makes appearances in person, though she has been known to use her psychic powers to contact those who she seeks help from. The people of Praetoria consider it one of the highest honors to be contacted directly by Praetor Tilman when she needs their aid.</color>"
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2522558736" "Mother will miss you, {HeroName}. Let's never forget the time that you and I spent with each other."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3364350566" "Mother has told Anti-Matter all about you, {HeroName}. He's asked that I show him favor by sending you his way."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FirstPage Text :
"P4274546816" "<color orange>You hear the laughter of a familiar voice: Praetor Tilman.</color><br><br>It's my <i>dear</i> {HeroName}. It's been some time since our last little talk, <i>hasn't</i> it? If I remember correctly, you said you were going to <i>make me pay for my crimes</i> the last time we talked? Though I'm not sure what you think... my <i>crimes</i> would be, other than <i>protecting the people of Praetoria.</i><br><br>Ah... you'll have to excuse me, {HeroName}. I can get... worked up at times. I'm sure you and I can put that <i>little</i> talk of ours behind us, yes? Your <i>dear</i> Mother comes to you today to ask you for help in protecting the people of Praetoria."
// Answer Text :
"P2819959068" "You? Protect the people of Praetoria?"
// Page WorkTogether Text :
"P1314177013" "You have <i>such</i> a <i>funny</i> sense of humor, {HeroName}. Of course, Mother <i>wants</i> to keep the people of Praetoria safe. Perhaps you just need to see the <i>true</i> light that your dear Mother casts, hrm? Yes, I believe you need to. It makes Mother very <i>disturbed</i> when people just don't <i>see</i> how hard I'm <i>trying</i> to <i>protect</i> you all. <br><br>Ahem... regardless of our past... <i>issues</i>, I think you and I could work together quite well. Don't you think? Mother would <i>love</i> for this to happen. Don't you want to protect the people of this little city, {HeroName}? If you do, then you and I will have a <i>splendid</i> time working together."
// Answer Text :
"P2432106795" "Alright, Tilman. What do you want?"
// Page SecondPage Text :
"P3830619235" "{HeroName}, it's been <i>far</i> too long since you and I have spoke. I have <i>such</i> fond memories of you from our time dealing with one of my troublesome little girls. I must apologize for them, as I don't think I ever did. I've made sure that those... <i>girls</i> have </i>PAID</i> for their </i>BETRAYAL</i> of my <i>TRUST</i>.<br><br>Ah... you'll have to forgive Mother. I <i>can</i> get very worked up when I'm betrayed by those who have earned my trust. But I know you would <i>never</i> betray me, would you {HeroName}? No, that's why I'm coming to you today to ask for your help."
// Answer Text :
"P2101931919" "What can I do for you, Mother?"
// Page WhatHeWants Text :
"P14260565" "Such a loyal {Hero.gender=male man|woman}! I would just <i>love</i> to <i>use</i> you for help in the future after this whole little matter is done.<br><br>You may know that Mother rarely relies on outside help. My little daughters normally handle everything that needs to be done. But in this case, I simply <i>must</i> ask for the help of someone like <i>you</i> to help defend Mother and Praetoria from those who would seek to destroy everything we stand for."
// Answer Text :
"P1380279492" "I'll do what it takes to help you, Mother."
// Page ThirdPage Text :
"P2371716541" "Why hello, {HeroName}. You've caught Mother's attention, as you can well see. But ah, perhaps you don't know exactly who I am? I'm sure you <i>do</i>, but I shall be formal about it. Where would we be, if we were never formal? I am the <color yellow>Praetor Tilman</color>, but you may call me <color yellow>Mother</color>. Normally, I do not request aid from members of Praetor White's Power Division. However, my little girls require some more aid in tracking some <i>very</i> troublesome criminals here in Praetoria."
// Answer Text :
"P2954392478" "What criminals are they having trouble with?"
// Page SortofMatters Text :
"P1667398993" "Rogue psychics, you could say. Who <i>dare</i> to believe that I don't have the <i>best</i> intentions for them... Who <i>dare</i> to... To... <i>spit</i> on my name! If they only <i>knew</i> how hard I worked, how much I <i>cared</i> for their well-being...<br><br>I apologize, {HeroName}. I just get so... <i>frustrated</i> when my good will is turned down by those who I only <i>wish</i> to help. Regardless, what say you and I begin our little <i>case</i>, as those men in the PPD would say?"
// Answer Text :
"P4061896994" "Alright, what're we doing first?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


