// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Neuron 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2528765221" "Neuron"
// ProfessionString :
"P1757306932" "Praetor of the Sciences"
// DescriptionString :
"P3465594729" "Praetor Berry, also known as Neuron, the fastest man alive, is the man in charge of the Science Academies of Praetoria. Capable of multi-tasking on a level unheard of, Neuron handles the job admirably. Though he is responsible for many great and marvelous breakthroughs, he is also responsible for some of the greatest atrocities imaginable. To him, the end results justify any and all means, and he pursues any and all means."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2489333997" "Little time for pleasantries, so a simple hello will have to suffice."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2938909712" "I haven't scheduled any time to interact with you at this juncture. Come back to me when you've made an appointment."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P4079836904" "My schedule does not account for more than two minutes and seventeen seconds of unscheduled interruptions per day. Now, if you want to be useful, go team up with someone else in Powers Division. I'm sure that together you can come up with a decent idea by the time I've reprogrammed every Clockwork in Praetoria. Aaaaand, too late."
// FirstVisitString :
"P592839267" "I may look rather busy but I assure you, I am giving you the appropriate amount of attention necessary at this time."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P862690345" "The results of several recent experiments have changed the course of my future endeavours for the foreseeable future. I have no need of your abilities at this time, but, I assure you that I will keep you in mind for when I do."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3443615376" "Listen, you aren't me. You can't handle a thousand different projects all at once. It's okay, we all have our uses. Take care of your business and then come and see me, I need those that help me to be focused on the task at hand."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2079964133" "I deal with dangerous experiments and their equally dangerous side effects. I need to make sure that you are at least Security Level {Level}, which it doesn't seem you are. Come back to me when you've remedied that situation."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2624653625" "You seem like a decent member of the Powers Division. I think you deserve a bit more of my attention than usual."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1496961042" "I've rarely met someone who can keep me interested for very long, but you are certainly worthy of my attention... For now."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1786277383" "No time to talk. That's all."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


