// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Bobcat 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Bobcat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P402673514" "Bobcat"
// ProfessionString :
"P1216570516" "Lazy Cat Girl"
// DescriptionString :
"P4094551361" "During the tail end of the Hamidon Wars, genetic hybrids were made by a variety of military and privately owned laboratories in an attempt to create super powered soldiers to fight the Devouring Earth. Bobcat is one such experiment that merged human and feline DNA. Left abandoned and forgotten after the war she eventually escaped from the lab and roamed the streets of Praetoria City until Neuron found her.<br><br>Initially feral and incredibly bad tempered, she quickly grew accustomed to civilized life. She has taken up a near permanent residence in Studio 55, using her influence as a Praetor's girlfriend to remodel the club as she sees fit."
// LocationString :
"P268986995" "Studio 55"
// HelloString :
"P1955154777" "Hey, you look like someone cool!  Ooops!  I was wrong.  Go away."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3335801394" "Do you know me?  I sure as heck don't know you.  Why don't you go talk with someone else who cares, got it?"
// WrongUniverseString :
"P2623131698" "I've never seen you around before, but something about you is vaguely familiar... I can't put my claw on it, but whatever it is I know I don't like it."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3015300845" "{Hero.gender=male Oh... I have a lot of <i>uses</i> in mind for a man like you. Hmmm... one thing at a time...|Oh... I could really use a friend like you right now.} {Hero.gender=male My <i>ex</i>-boyfriend, <color red>Neuron</color> doesn't spend any time with me anymore. Ugh, I really should just dump him, but I guess he's better than <i>nothing</i>... |My <i>jerk</i> of a boyfriend, <color yellow>Stephen</color>, is all but ignoring me lately... I should dump him, I deserve better, don't you think? I mean, I'm cute, and pretty, and I could <i>totally</i> get any guy I wanted, right?}<br><br>The only time he even talks to me is when he wants me to do some work. Pffft, what do I look like to him? An employee? {Hero.gender=male I <i>was</i> his girlfriend!|I'm his girlfriend!}<br><br>He's cheating on me, huh? I know he is, nobody <i>works</i> that many hours... Hmph, well, I'll show him just what he threw away!<br><br>But enough about that insensitive jerk, right now I need to just get out and dance so I can forget about him. Hey, you should come dance with me!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4037360900" "What?  No, there's nothing more to do right now.  Well, I don't know, maybe there is, but I don't really care."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P688656513" "You know how I've got so much work to do and so little time to get it done, right?  Well, how am I supposed to get it done if you're doing work for other people?!  Finish those other tasks and get back here, pronto!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2200623145" "I do the most important work for Neuron, which is why he picked me and not you.  Maybe if you were as important as me, like say Security Level {Level}, then maaaaaaybe I might let you help.  Until then, scram!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2209741425" "You really like running around and doing stuff, don't you?  Well I don't, so I think we can make a good team.  Let me get your number so I can call you when I've got work to do."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1063329782" "I really like how you get out there and do a good job, you know that?  It makes it so much easier on me."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P935908960" "Go talk to someone else, can't you see I'm busy here?"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
