// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Calvin_Scott 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 34 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Calvin Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4278277396" "Calvin Scott"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1834117021" "Calvin Scott is the single charismatic force that has unified the scattered fragments of society that oppose Marcus Cole's rule, and the Empire he has constructed. A simple man in origin, Scott did not realize his calling until his wife, Aurora, was stolen from him by Praetor Tilman, a.k.a. Mother Mayhem. Now Tilman wears his wife's body and masquerades as some sort of tragic protector of the people. Though the Resistance is a means to overthrowing Cole, Tilman, and the other villains who have taken over the world, to Scott they are a means to rescuing his wife."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2677152253" "I still remember the way she used to look at me when we first met. I didn't know she was a telepath then. Heh... the things running through my head, shameful. It's a wonder she ever said hello to me. It was before all of this - President Cole hadn't even fought the Hamidon yet. The world changed after that. Everything changed. She became more involved in the cause, she always was civic minded. I guess that's how Mother Mayhem learned about her. With the power Aurora had, you'd have to be in a coma to not feel that power. But anyway, sorry, I got a little lost there."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1504357294" "I don't think it's a good idea for us to talk right now, {HeroName}.  Keep in contact with {LastContactName} until the time is right."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3066083666" "You must be {HeroName}. I can tell by the way you came over here. All of you powered-types have that... I don't know what to call it, that 'thing' about you. It's this sense of power and control you don't see in the rest of us. She use to have that, it's one of the things I loved about her. Every room she walked into, it was like it was built just for her to exist in for that moment and then when she would leave, it'd simply cease to exist. It was intoxicating, but now without her, I feel like that room."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3741849369" "Tyrant appears to be licking his wounds at this time. That doesn't mean he won't strike back with a vengeance when he has recovered.  But we'll be waiting."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P795260715" "If you're going to help fight in our crusade, you're going to need to be able to take on tasks assigned to you.  You're handling too many things for other people right now."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1290847835" "HeroName, you're too valuable an operative to volunteer you for a suicide mission.  Check back with me when you're Security Level {Level}"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P576806820" "You've shown you have the courage to do what is necessary, {HeroName}.  I'm now entrusting with my personal number so that you can contact me when you need to."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P697184621" "I knew that you were vital to our cause from the moment I laid eyes on you, {HeroName}.  With your help, we've managed to strike a mortal blow to the foundations of Tyrant's false empire."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


