// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P166058921" "Doctor Steven Sheridan"
// ProfessionString :
"P2344909358" "Primal Earth Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P62422460" "When Dr Steven 'Science' Sheridan was young, his parents thought him a brilliant child prodigy. As it turned out, they had greatly underestimated their son. Some people think he's a mutant; others suspect he's the product of genetic engineering. Either way, he's without a doubt the most knowledgeable human being who ever lived. 'Doc Science' never forgets a single fact; once he learns something, it is locked in his memory forever. His great intellect allows him to easily recall these facts and draw inferences from them; as one might imagine, this makes him one heck of a scientist.<br><br>It is because of this that the forces from Primal Earth have requested Dr. Steven Sheridan's assistance in investigating matters within Praetoria."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3223986881" "Time is of the essence, {HeroName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
// WrongUniverseString :
"P274226440" "The best thing you can do right now is try and blend in. As far as anyone here knows, you're a member of Powers Division. But if anyone bothers to try and look you up then they're going to find you are not registered with the Division. Lend a helping hand to those helping the Resistance, but do not take center stage or our good work here could be discovered and undone in an instant."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2263199791" "Greetings, {HeroName}! As you may or may not know, I am Dr. Steven Sheridan. I am a resident from Primal Earth, but I am here to assist you and any other member in the Resistance to get through to Primal Earth."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3578195132" "Settle anything that you need to finish and then speak with me, {HeroName}."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
