// Name :
"P1731584901" "Noble Savage"
// ProfessionString :
"P3692127934" "Mutated Monstrosity"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P389135220" "Don't look at me.  DON'T look at me!! DON'T LOOK AT ME!!!!  GRRAARRHH!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3344435146" "What?  Have you come to stare at this Savage?  Have you come to mock me?  IS THAT WHY YOU'RE HERE?!  Leave.  Run.  Run for your life, {HeroName}.  Or I shall tear your life apart!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3738292336" "You talk to me like I am still a man.  But I'm not anymore.  Now I'm a monster!  A MONSTER!!!  I can no longer help Praetoria.  Men, women, and even children scream in terror when I venture above these tunnels.  They show me that I am no longer human.  I can never be a man again, so why should I act like one?  If they see a monster, then I WILL BE THAT MONSTER THEY FEAR!<br> <br>No.  No, I will not become that which I hate.  But I can not live like this either.  You& you have more humanity than I do.  Please.  Please use that humanity and grant one small request&"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2153271598" "I have no more requests, {HeroName}.  Now it is time to repay your kindness by helping the people of Praetoria City.  Perhaps we shall see each other again."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3784190229" "I know I have already asked much of you, {HeroName}, but there are others that need your assistance.  Once you have finished helping the others, I have another request of you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P786864101" "What I am to ask of you would require you to be Security Level {Level}.  Until then, I can not ask you to put yourself on the line for something like me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P41036636" "You saw something in me, {HeroName}, that I could no longer see.  I need to keep seeing what it is that you see& friend."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3872547136" "I owe you, {HeroName}.  I owe you more than I could ever repay you.  You have shown me that there still is hope in this world, no matter how grotesque the outside appearance may be.  Thank you.  Thank you so much."
